211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 186 0 R
/E (By bringing the Bitcoin Cash vision directly onto campuses, Campus Connect gives students hands-on exposure to peer-to-peer digital cash, practical blockchain literacy, and the tools to actually build with the technology  not just talk about it. Instead of leaving young Africans to piece together fragmented information online, the initiative creates a structured pathway: workshops, campus ambassadors, and real-world use cases that show students how BCH can power everyday commerce and financial inclusion across the continent.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 186 0 R
/E (The goal isn't just awareness  it's capacity. Campus Connect aims to turn curious students into informed users, builders, and advocates, ensuring the next wave of African innovation is grounded in genuine understanding of what Bitcoin Cash makes possible.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
